@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Account holder" as User
actor "Reviewer / group admin" as Reviewer
rectangle "SplitSmart system" {
  usecase "Manage account and groups" as Groups
  usecase "Submit and review expense" as Expense
  usecase "View balances and reports" as Reports
  usecase "Record and reconcile payment" as Payment
  usecase "Receive in-app notification" as Notice
}
User --> Groups
User --> Expense
User --> Reports
User --> Payment
User --> Notice
Reviewer --> Expense
Reviewer --> Payment
note bottom of "SplitSmart system"
  Browser-based delivery is customer target (RI-010).
  Swing is an academic subset only.
  External services are not assumed.
end note
@enduml
